Tokenizers. The Python package downloads tokenizer files from their publishers at
run time (pinned revisions, SHA-256 checked); it contains none. The browser page
built by scripts/build_space.py contains tokenizer files licensed under MIT or
Apache-2.0, in a re-encoded form; LICENSES/README.md lists each file, its source,
its licence and the changes made. tiktoken and js-tiktoken are MIT-licensed
(Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI, Shantanu Jain). tokenizers.js (@huggingface/tokenizers)
is Apache-2.0-licensed (Hugging Face). base64-js is MIT-licensed (Copyright (c)
2014 Jameson Little). Qwen tokenizer files: Copyright Alibaba Cloud, Apache-2.0.
DeepSeek tokenizer file: Copyright (c) 2023 DeepSeek, MIT.

Font. The browser page bundles IBM Plex Sans Arabic, version 1.005: the unmodified
files IBMPlexSansArabic-Regular.woff2 and IBMPlexSansArabic-SemiBold.woff2 from
IBM's npm package @ibm/plex-sans-arabic 1.1.0. Copyright 2017 IBM Corp. with
Reserved Font Name "Plex". SIL Open Font License 1.1 (web/fonts/OFL.txt).

Prices in src/token_tax_calculator/data/prices.json are facts read from the
vendors' public price pages on the retrieval date given for each row; the pages
themselves are not reproduced.

Runtime dependencies of the Python package: tiktoken (MIT), tokenizers
(Apache-2.0), sentencepiece (Apache-2.0), huggingface_hub (Apache-2.0).

